      <!-- ── 1. AUTHENTICATION ─────────────────────── -->
      <section class="topic-section" id="authentication">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-title">
            <i class="ti ti-user-check" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px"></i>
            Authentication
            <span class="badge badge-blue">Core</span>
          </div>
          <p class="definition">Authentication (often abbreviated as <strong>AuthN</strong>) is the process of verifying that someone is who they claim to be. It's the first checkpoint before granting access to any system. Think of it as the lock on a door — you must prove you have the right key.</p>

