            <div class="cons">
              <div class="cons-title">Limitations</div>
              <div class="pc-item">− Passwords can be stolen or guessed</div>
              <div class="pc-item">− Adds friction to user experience</div>
              <div class="pc-item">− Can be bypassed with phishing</div>
            </div>
          </div>

