      <!-- ── 2. AUTHORIZATION ─────────────────────── -->
      <section class="topic-section" id="authorization">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-title">
            <i class="ti ti-key" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px"></i>
            Authorization
            <span class="badge badge-blue">Core</span>
          </div>
          <p class="definition">Authorization (often abbreviated as <strong>AuthZ</strong>) determines what an authenticated user is allowed to do. After you prove who you are (authentication), the system decides what resources and actions you can access. These are two distinct steps — you can be authenticated but still unauthorized for certain actions.</p>

