            <div class="cons">
              <div class="cons-title">Limitations</div>
              <div class="pc-item">− More friction at login</div>
              <div class="pc-item">− SMS-based MFA vulnerable to SIM swap</div>
              <div class="pc-item">− Device dependency</div>
