          <div class="section-label">Real-Life Examples</div>
          <div class="example-box"><strong>Real Life — Instagram / Twitter:</strong> You log in with your password. The platform sends a 6-digit code to your phone via SMS or authenticator app. You enter the code within 30 seconds. Even if someone steals your password, they cannot log in without your phone.</div>
          <div class="example-box"><strong>Real Life — ATM Machine:</strong> You insert your debit card (something you have) and enter your PIN (something you know). This is classic 2FA that has protected banking transactions for decades.</div>
          <div class="example-box"><strong>Real Life — Tax Filing (HMRC/IRS):</strong> Government tax portals require you to enter your password, then verify via a code sent to your phone or email before accessing sensitive financial records.</div>

          <div class="section-label">Step-by-Step Process</div>
          <div class="step-row"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-text">Factor 1: Enter username + password</div></div>
