          <div class="section-label">Real-Life Examples</div>
          <div class="example-box"><strong>Real Life — Online Shopping Verification:</strong> When you make a large online purchase, your bank sends a 6-digit OTP to your registered phone number. You enter it on the checkout page to authorize the transaction. It expires in 3–5 minutes.</div>
          <div class="example-box"><strong>Real Life — Password Reset:</strong> You click 'Forgot Password'. The site sends a one-time code to your email or phone. This OTP is valid for a single use within 10 minutes — after that, it expires even if unused.</div>
          <div class="example-box"><strong>Everyday App — Google Authenticator:</strong> The app generates a new 6-digit TOTP every 30 seconds using a shared secret key and the current time. The server generates the same code simultaneously — if they match, you're authenticated.</div>

          <div class="section-label">Step-by-Step Process</div>
          <div class="step-row"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-text">Shared secret established between user and server at setup</div></div>
          <div class="step-row"><div class="step-num">2</div><div class="step-text">User requests access, server triggers OTP</div></div>
          <div class="step-row"><div class="step-num">3</div><div class="step-text">OTP generated using time (TOTP) or counter (HOTP)</div></div>
          <div class="step-row"><div class="step-num">4</div><div class="step-text">User enters OTP within the validity window</div></div>
          <div class="step-row"><div class="step-num">5</div><div class="step-text">Server verifies using same algorithm — access granted</div></div>

          <div class="section-label">Strengths &amp; Weaknesses</div>
          <div class="pros-cons">
            <div class="pros">
              <div class="pros-title">Strengths</div>
              <div class="pc-item">+ Replay attacks impossible</div>
              <div class="pc-item">+ Simple to generate and verify</div>
              <div class="pc-item">+ Works offline (TOTP apps)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="cons">
              <div class="cons-title">Limitations</div>
              <div class="pc-item">− Time sync issues cause failures</div>
              <div class="pc-item">− SMS OTPs interceptable</div>
              <div class="pc-item">− Lost device = locked out</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="section-label">Related Terms</div>
