      <!-- ── 7. BIOMETRICS ────────────────────────── -->
      <section class="topic-section" id="biometrics">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-title">
            <i class="ti ti-fingerprint" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px"></i>
            Biometrics
            <span class="badge badge-amber">Security</span>
          </div>
          <p class="definition">Biometric authentication uses unique physical or behavioral characteristics to verify identity. Unlike passwords, biometrics can't be forgotten, are extremely hard to forge, and are always with you. They are increasingly used as the 'something you are' factor in MFA.</p>

          <div class="section-label">How it works — Flow Diagram</div>
          <svg class="flow-svg" viewBox="0 0 640 190" role="img">
