              <div class="pc-item">− Role explosion (too many custom roles)</div>
              <div class="pc-item">− Static; cannot evaluate dynamic conditions (like time)</div>
              <div class="pc-item">− Vulnerable to permission accumulation over time</div>
            </div>
          </div>

