          <div class="lab-card">
            <h4>Dynamic RBAC Policy Designer</h4>
            <p class="lab-desc">Configure permissions globally for Admin, Editor, and Viewer roles below. These policy changes immediately inject into the "AAA Playground Login" simulator tab above.</p>
            
            <div class="table-responsive">
              <table class="rbac-matrix-table" id="rbac-matrix">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Role</th>
                    <th>Read Database <br><small>DB_VIEW</small></th>
                    <th>Edit Database <br><small>DB_EDIT</small></th>
                    <th>Drop Database <br><small>DB_DELETE</small></th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="role-cell"><i class="ti ti-user-shield text-red"></i> Admin</td>
                    <td><input type="checkbox" id="p-admin-read" checked=""></td>
                    <td><input type="checkbox" id="p-admin-edit" checked=""></td>
                    <td><input type="checkbox" id="p-admin-delete" checked=""></td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="role-cell"><i class="ti ti-edit text-amber"></i> Editor</td>
                    <td><input type="checkbox" id="p-editor-read" checked=""></td>
                    <td><input type="checkbox" id="p-editor-edit" checked=""></td>
                    <td><input type="checkbox" id="p-editor-delete"></td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="role-cell"><i class="ti ti-user text-blue"></i> Viewer</td>
                    <td><input type="checkbox" id="p-viewer-read" checked=""></td>
                    <td><input type="checkbox" id="p-viewer-edit"></td>
                    <td><input type="checkbox" id="p-viewer-delete"></td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            
            <div class="rbac-save-indicator" id="rbac-policy-status">
              <i class="ti ti-cloud-check text-green"></i> Policy rules updated and synced with Auth database. Try executing actions in the AAA tab!
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- TAB CONTENT: SSO STEPPER -->
        <div class="lab-content" id="tab-sso">
          <div class="lab-card">
            <h4>Interactive Federated OIDC SSO Redirect Stepper</h4>
            <p class="lab-desc">Watch how SSO transfers auth tokens between the client browser, corporate Zoom, and your company's Identity Provider (Okta).</p>
            
            <div class="sso-visualizer-container">
              <!-- Node Browser -->
              <div class="sso-node active" id="sso-node-browser">
                <i class="ti ti-device-laptop"></i>
                <div class="node-title">User Browser</div>
                <div class="node-ip">192.168.1.45</div>
              </div>

              <!-- Connector arrows -->
              <div class="sso-channel">
                <div class="channel-arrow channel-to-sp" id="channel-browser-sp"></div>
                <div class="channel-arrow channel-to-browser" id="channel-sp-browser"></div>
              </div>

              <!-- Node Zoom (SP) -->
              <div class="sso-node" id="sso-node-sp">
                <i class="ti ti-video"></i>
                <div class="node-title">Service Provider</div>
                <div class="node-sub">Zoom Client</div>
              </div>

              <!-- Connector arrows -->
              <div class="sso-channel vertical-channel">
                <div class="channel-arrow channel-to-idp" id="channel-browser-idp"></div>
                <div class="channel-arrow channel-from-idp" id="channel-idp-browser"></div>
              </div>

              <!-- Node Okta (IdP) -->
              <div class="sso-node" id="sso-node-idp">
                <i class="ti ti-shield"></i>
                <div class="node-title">Identity Provider</div>
                <div class="node-sub">Okta Auth Server</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Stepper controls -->
            <div class="sso-controls-row">
              <button class="lab-btn btn-secondary" id="btn-sso-prev" disabled="">Previous Step</button>
              <span class="sso-step-indicator" id="sso-step-indicator">Step 1 of 6</span>
              <button class="lab-btn" id="btn-sso-next">Next Step</button>
              <button class="lab-btn btn-secondary" id="btn-sso-reset">Reset Flow</button>
            </div>

            <!-- Stepper explain card -->
            <div class="sso-explain-box" id="sso-explain-text">
              <strong>Step 1: Accessing Zoom.</strong> The employee opens the Zoom application and clicks "Login with SSO." No local session exists, so the client app prepares to redirect the user to authenticate centrally.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- TAB CONTENT: JWT INSPECTOR -->
        <div class="lab-content" id="tab-jwt">
          <div class="lab-grid-jwt">
            <div class="lab-card">
              <h4>Encoded JWT String (Encoded Base64URL)</h4>
              <p class="lab-desc">Tamper with this base64 JWT payload token on the right to see if the signature verification fails on the server!</p>
              
              <div class="jwt-encoded-box">
                <span class="jwt-header-part" id="jwt-enc-header">eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9</span>.<span class="jwt-payload-part" id="jwt-enc-payload">eyJzdWIiOiIxMjM0NTY3ODkwIiwibmFtZSI6IkFsaWNlIiwicm9sZSI6ImFkbWluIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg5OTk5OTk5fQ</span>.<span class="jwt-signature-part" id="jwt-enc-signature">NjZhZjE0ZDZDcnlwdG9ITUFDU2lnSGFzaFN0cmluZ1NlY3JldEtleXM</span>
              </div>

              <div class="jwt-server-check-card">
                <h5>Server Verification Output</h5>
                <div class="jwt-status-badge badge-success" id="jwt-verification-badge"><i class="ti ti-circle-check"></i> Valid Token (Signature Verified)</div>
                <div class="jwt-status-desc" id="jwt-verification-desc">Algorithm: HMAC-SHA256. The payload matches the cryptographic signature created using the server's private secret.</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Editable JSON Payload -->
            <div class="lab-card">
              <h4>Decoded Decryptor &amp; Editor</h4>
              
              <div class="decoded-section">
                <div class="decoded-title text-red">HEADER: <small>ALGORITHM &amp; TOKEN TYPE</small></div>
                <pre class="decoded-code"><code>{
  "alg": "HS256",
  "typ": "JWT"
}</code></pre>
              </div>

              <div class="decoded-section">
                <div class="decoded-title text-purple">PAYLOAD: <small>CLAIMS &amp; DATA (EDITABLE)</small></div>
                <div class="form-group-compact">
                  <label for="jwt-payload-sub">Subject (User ID)</label>
                  <input type="text" id="jwt-payload-sub" value="1234567890">
                </div>
                <div class="form-group-compact">
                  <label for="jwt-payload-name">User Name</label>
                  <input type="text" id="jwt-payload-name" value="Alice">
                </div>
                <div class="form-group-compact">
                  <label for="jwt-payload-role">Role Claims</label>
                  <select id="jwt-payload-role">
                    <option value="admin" selected="">admin</option>
                    <option value="editor">editor</option>
                    <option value="viewer">viewer</option>
                  </select>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group-compact">
                  <label for="jwt-payload-exp">Expiration Time (Epoch)</label>
                  <input type="number" id="jwt-payload-exp" value="1789999999">
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="decoded-section">
                <div class="decoded-title text-blue">VERIFICATION SECRET KEY</div>
                <div class="form-group-compact">
                  <input type="text" id="jwt-secret-input" value="SuperSecretAuthKey2026">
                  <small class="slider-help">Changing this secret will instantly invalidate the signature above unless verified with the matching key.</small>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════
           QUIZ SECTION
      ══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <section class="topic-section" id="quiz-section">
        <div class="card quiz-card">
          <div class="quiz-welcome-view" id="quiz-welcome-view">
            <h2 class="quiz-title">
              <i class="ti ti-award text-amber"></i> Security Access Control Certification Quiz
            </h2>
            <p class="quiz-intro-text">Ready to test your knowledge? This assessment comprises 10 questions covering all 12 core concepts. Pass with <strong>80% or higher (8+ correct)</strong> to earn your digital certification certificate.</p>
            
            <div class="quiz-stats-cards">
              <div class="stat-mini">
                <i class="ti ti-help"></i>
